{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLTremoloV5colorAA8MXLColorVSgvp","title":"color","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/color"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/color"]}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTremolo"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTremolo"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo","title":"MXLTremolo","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tremolo ornament can be used to indicate single-note, double-note, or unmeasured tremolos. Single-note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tremolos use the single type, double-note tremolos use the start and stop types, and unmeasured tremolos use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the unmeasured type. The default is “single” for compatibility with Version 1.1. The text of the element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates the number of tremolo marks and is an integer from 0 to 8. Note that the number of attached beams is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not included in this value, but is represented separately using the beam element. The value should be 0 for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unmeasured tremolos."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLColor":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlcolor","title":"MXLColor","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLColor"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The color type indicates the color of an element. Color may be represented as hexadecimal RGB triples, as in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"HTML, or as hexadecimal ARGB tuples, with the A indicating alpha of transparency. An alpha value of 00 is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"totally transparent; FF is totally opaque. If RGB is used, the A value is assumed to be FF."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLColor"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo/color":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/color","title":"color","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"color","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLColor","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/color"}}}